.env.local

# convex/_generated is intentionally TRACKED (2026-08-11).
# Vercel builds in the cloud with no Convex credentials and the web build has no
# codegen step, so an ignored _generated meant Vercel type-checked against a
# stale copy left in its build cache — production went ~2 months without a
# successful deploy because of it.
# If you add or rename a Convex function, run `npx convex codegen` and commit
# the result, or the web build will fail on a missing api.* member.
